---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---

<section class="box skills">
  <div class="skill stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
    <Icon
      icon="terminal-window"
      color="var(--accent-regular)"
      size="2.5rem"
      gradient
    />

    <h2>Back-End</h2>

    <p>
      Conception et développement d'API REST et de services robustes avec Java,
      Spring Boot et SQL.
    </p>

    <div class="technologies">
      <span>Java</span>
      <span>Spring Boot</span>
      <span>REST API</span>
      <span>SQL</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="skill stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
    <Icon icon="code" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.5rem" gradient />

    <h2>Front-End</h2>

    <p>
      Création d'interfaces web modernes, responsives et maintenables avec React
      et TypeScript.
    </p>

    <div class="technologies">
      <span>React</span>
      <span>TypeScript</span>
      <span>JavaScript</span>
      <span>HTML / CSS</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="skill stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
    <Icon
      icon="strategy"
      color="var(--accent-regular)"
      size="2.5rem"
      gradient
    />

    <h2>Full-Stack &amp; DevOps</h2>

    <p>
      Intervention sur l'ensemble du cycle de développement : intégration,
      tests, conteneurisation, déploiement et maintenance.
    </p>

    <div class="technologies">
      <span>Docker</span>
      <span>Git</span>
      <span>CI/CD</span>
      <span>Tests</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .box {
    border: 1px solid var(--gray-800);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background-color: var(--gray-999_40);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .skills {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .skill {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .skills h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
  }

  .skills p {
    color: var(--gray-400);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .technologies {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .technologies span {
    padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--gray-800);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--gray-300);
    background: var(--gray-999_40);
  }

  @media (min-width: 50em) {
    .box {
      border-radius: 1.5rem;
      padding: 2.5rem;
    }

    .skills {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 4rem;
    }

    .skills h2 {
      font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    }
  }
</style>
